The chips.

1313
00:53:05.320 --> 00:53:06.500
The chips, you guys.

1314
00:53:06.740 --> 00:53:09.540
The chips that Phil Shea got are at the bar.

1315
00:53:09.760 --> 00:53:10.280
Yes.

1316
00:53:10.360 --> 00:53:13.540
