1317
00:53:13.840 --> 00:53:14.940
They're in a red and white.

1318
00:53:15.220 --> 00:53:15.640
Ketchup flavor.

1319
00:53:15.860 --> 00:53:17.120
Oh, yes, lady.

1320
00:53:17.540 --> 00:53:19.520
Why do I do that with my voice?

1321
