1356
00:54:20.560 --> 00:54:20.920
That's right.

1357
00:54:20.980 --> 00:54:26.900
He says to the bartender, Mademoiselle, beer me, dose Long Island iced teas, see vous play.

1358
00:54:27.320 --> 00:54:28.840
Bad decision in a glass.

1359
00:54:28.840 --> 00:54:30.880
It is a bad decision in a glass.

1360
00:54:31.080 --> 00:54:31.940
It is a horrible decision.

1361
00:54:32.140 --> 00:54:34.720
You know how you've had a volcano and you did the splits?

1362
00:54:34.980 --> 00:54:35.320
Yes.

1363
