1365
00:54:38.600 --> 00:54:42.100
In the Bahamas on spring break with my friends.

1366
00:54:42.660 --> 00:54:44.540
I never had one before.

1367
00:54:44.920 --> 00:54:48.800
I wasn't 21 yet, but in the Bahamas, you can drink when you're 18.

1368
00:54:49.260 --> 00:54:55.060
We went to the casino and they just give them to you free if you sit at the slot machines.

1369
00:54:55.340 --> 00:54:55.940
I have not.

1370
00:54:55.940 --> 00:54:58.300
All of this was like, what is happening?

1371
00:54:58.300 --> 00:55:00.480
I have not had a Long Island iced tea.

1372
00:55:00.660 --> 00:55:02.780
I've had the volcano, but it's just the same thing.

1373
00:55:02.840 --> 00:55:04.560
They just dump a bunch of booze in it, right?

1374
00:55:04.620 --> 00:55:06.480
It's like seven or eight different liquors.

1375
00:55:07.480 --> 00:55:07.920
Tasty.

1376
00:55:08.120 --> 00:55:09.220
Went down easy.

1377
00:55:09.480 --> 00:55:09.980
Well, yeah.

1378
00:55:10.460 --> 00:55:11.540
Then a lot of vomiting.

1379
00:55:11.740 --> 00:55:12.940
A lot of vomiting.

1380
00:55:13.300 --> 00:55:16.980
Well, we got a fan question about this scene from Evan L.

1381
00:55:17.500 --> 00:55:23.100
At 11 minutes, 14 seconds, Andy says, you will thank me when they spank thee.

1382
00:55:23.500 --> 00:55:26.100
